{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">王嘉慧（Cathy）早前飛到日本旅遊，當然不忘在社交平台向粉絲大派福利！日前她上載了一輯在當地潮流聖地街頭拍攝的打卡靚相，盡顯大好身段，瞬間吸引大批網民俾Like。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"ad8ecc3b-aa28-42ac-a370-7146d538fd0d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026DFzSmcwbPX1791428046.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"ad8ecc3b-aa28-42ac-a370-7146d538fd0d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">相片中的 Cathy 身穿一襲純白斜膊無袖短款背心，大方展露迷人的鎖骨與白滑香肩。上衣腰間側邊的剪裁極具巧思，若隱若現展露纖腰；下半身則搭配充滿夏日氣息的淺藍色細條紋短裙。她優雅地坐在街頭欄杆邊，完美大騷一雙雪白修長的逆天美腿，畫面極度養眼！</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"a6135d3f-3b03-4135-aa22-677a40e6e31b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026VSI4siXthK1791428045.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"a6135d3f-3b03-4135-aa22-677a40e6e31b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">靚相一出，隨即引來大批網民及粉絲留言洗版狂讚。大家紛紛「心心眼」大讚：「Cathy 身材保養得太好了」、「性感又靚女」、「零死角長腿女神」，更有粉絲直接激讚她是「街頭最靚嘅風景！」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T03:20:37.007503+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":295,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}